<view class="page"><image class="background" src="{{background}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="content"><view class="brand-head"/><view class="card"><view class="eyebrow">加入竞技 · 记录荣誉</view><view class="title">欢迎来到 27Nuts</view><view class="muted">查看赛事积分与排名，让每一份奖励都有迹可循。</view><view class="divider"/><view class="field-label">昵称（可选，后续可修改）</view><input type="nickname" maxlength="80" placeholder="输入你希望展示的昵称" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="nicknameInput"/><view class="note" bindtap="toggleAgree">{{agreed?'☑':'☐'}} 我已知晓：登录将创建门店会员档案；昵称与会员 ID 会展示在赛事排行榜，积分和奖励由门店记录。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="full" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">微信登录</button><view class="note">已有门店档案的玩家，请先向店员确认账号记录，避免使用不同身份重复记分。</view></view></view></view>
